---
layout: base.njk
title: "Always Yesterday Party"
description: "Always Yesterday Party（AYP）公式コーポレートサイト。プロジェクト情報・理念・ディスコグラフィを掲載しています。"
permalink: /
---
<main>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-navy/90 via-navy/60 to-white/70"></div>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-64 w-64 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-orange/25 blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-14 pb-10 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-14">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/80 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-navy shadow-soft">
            <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-orange"></span>
            接続を、企業活動として。
          </div>
          <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Always Yesterday Party（AYP）</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/90">
            過去の価値と未来の可能性をつなぎ、プロジェクト・コミュニティ・デジタル体験を
            ひとつの“企業の仕組み”として届けます。
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
            <a href="/projects/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy shadow-soft hover:opacity-95">
              事業を見る
            </a>
            <a href="/about/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/40 bg-white/10 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/15">
              理念を読む
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/80 p-4 glass shadow-soft">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Focus</div>
              <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-navy">企画〜運用</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/80 p-4 glass shadow-soft">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Mode</div>
              <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-navy">静的・速い体験</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/80 p-4 glass shadow-soft">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Outcome</div>
              <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-navy">分かりやすい情報</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/80 p-5 glass shadow-soft">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy">最新の更新</div>
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">
                <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-orange"></span>
                Live
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
              <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4">
                <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">2026-06</div>
                <h3 class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-navy">公開準備中</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">事業情報・導入の考え方・ブランドガイドを順次反映します。</p>
              </article>
              <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4">
                <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">About</div>
                <h3 class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-navy">AYPの“接続”を言語化</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">人・モノ・情報をつなげる設計思想を、ページに落とし込みます。</p>
              </article>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">お問い合わせ</div>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800">プロジェクト相談はフォームから。</p>
              <a href="/contact/" class="mt-3 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-95">
                フォームへ
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 text-center text-xs text-white/70">
            <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-black/10 px-3 py-1">Static HTML • Fast</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy">AYPが提供する価値</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">企業向けの情報発信・企画・運用を、最短で形にします。</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/projects/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-orange hover:opacity-90">詳しく見る →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-navy/5 p-3">
            <div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-orange" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-navy">コーポレート設計</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">目的・対象・情報設計から導線まで。静的でも伝わる構造にします。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-navy/5 p-3">
            <div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-orange" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-navy">ブランド運用</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">ロゴ・トーン・文章の統一。更新しやすいテンプレ構成で整えます。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-navy/5 p-3">
            <div class="h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-orange" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-navy">高速な公開</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">静的サイトなので軽量・高速。Cloudflare Pagesなどにそのまま載せられます。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-4 pt-2">
      <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy">導入のプロセス</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">“考え”を、“見える体験”に変えるための流れです。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">
        {% for step in range(1,5) %}
          <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-soft">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-orange">Step {{ "0" ~ step }}</div>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy">{% if step == 1 %}ヒアリング{% elif step == 2 %}設計{% elif step == 3 %}実装{% else %}運用・改善{% endif %}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
              {% if step == 1 %}現状・課題・伝えたいことを整理します。{% elif step == 2 %}情報設計と導線、必要なページ構成を決めます。{% elif step == 3 %}静的で速い体験を、実際の画面として作ります。{% else %}文章・更新導線を整え、継続しやすくします。{% endif %}
            </p>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 p-7">
        <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
          <div class="lg:col-span-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy">事業領域（現在の準備状況）</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">詳細はページに分けて順次公開します。まずは全体像をご覧ください。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a href="/projects/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-95">事業を見る</a>
            <a href="/about/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy hover:bg-slate-50">理念へ</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-soft">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Content</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold text-navy">情報発信設計</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-soft">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Digital</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold text-navy">Web体験の最適化</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-soft">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-grayish">Brand</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold text-navy">ブランド運用の設計</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-16">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-navy p-8 text-white shadow-soft">
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-center">
          <div class="md:col-span-8">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">まずは一度、相談してみませんか？</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-white/85">要件が固まっていなくてもOK。現状を聞かせてください。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-4">
            <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-95">お問い合わせ</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
